&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


Visual Walkthrough &amp;amp; Features:
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dual-Input Dropzone&lt;/strong&gt;: Visual image scanning alongside quick-tag ingredient chips.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Strict Pure Veg Shield&lt;/strong&gt;: Rejects meat, poultry, seafood, eggs, gelatin, and animal broths while intelligently preserving veg terms like &lt;em&gt;eggplant&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;chickpeas&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Tactile Sloth Aesthetic&lt;/strong&gt;: Warm cream (&lt;code&gt;#faf6f0&lt;/code&gt;), roasted brown (&lt;code&gt;#2b2420&lt;/code&gt;), and emerald green (&lt;code&gt;#10b981&lt;/code&gt;) color palette with light and dark mode toggling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Offline Sloth Mode&lt;/strong&gt;: Fully functional with &lt;strong&gt;zero API key required&lt;/strong&gt; through a built-in algorithmic culinary heuristic engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




